2. In this Order, unless the context otherwise requires —
“new entry levy” means an entry levy specified in the Casino Control (Variation of Entry Levies) Order 2019 (G.N. No. S 287/2019) as replacing the entry levy in section 116(1)(a) or (b) of the Act;
“pre-paid entry levy” means an entry levy specified in section 116(1)(a) or (b) of the Act as in force immediately before 4 April 2019, paid to a casino operator before that date under regulation 4(1) of the Casino Control (Entry Levy) Regulations 2010 (G.N. No. S 52/2010);
“validity period” has the meaning given by regulation 2 of the Casino Control (Entry Levy) Regulations 2010.
